35", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". ὄλβος οὐκ ἐς μακρὸν ἔρχεται for no long time,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pi. P. 3.105", "author_abbreviation": "Pi.", "tlg_author": "0033", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἐς τὰ μακρότατα to the utmost,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Th. 6.31", "author_abbreviation": "Th.", "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; v. μακράν"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "11", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". ἐπὶ μακρόν far, a long way,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "πορεύεσθαι X. Cyr. 5.4.47", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; of Time,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Call. Del. 255", "author_abbreviation": "Call.", "tlg_author": "0533", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ὅσον ἐπὶ μακρότατον οἷοί τε ἐγενόμεθα ἐξικέσθαι ἀκοῇ Hdt. 4.16", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "2.34", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(ἐπὶ omitted"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "1.171", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "codd.);"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τοσόνδε ἐπὶ μ. ἐπυθόμην Id. 2.29", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἐπὶ μακρότερον yet more,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Th. 4.41", "author_abbreviation": "Th.", "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". regul. Comp. and Sup. , v. supr.: irreg. Comp. μάσσων, Sup. μήκιστος, v. sub vocc. Adv. -